  real financial consequence: a softened "cannot be recovered", or a vague "anyone with these
  words", is the difference between someone keeping their coins and losing them. These need a
  fluent reader before release. Ordinary UI text is safe to iterate on.

  Brand names (DigiByte, DGB) are left untranslated on purpose.
-->
